{"symbol":"BOROSCI","yahoo":"BOROSCI.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE02L001032","sme":null,"name":"Borosil Scientific Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","website":"https://www.borosilscientific.com","about":"Borosil Scientific Limited engages in the manufacture and sale of laboratory glassware. It offers glassware and consumables, including lab glassware, filtration products, and analytical vials; laboratory instrumentation for use in nutrition and environment, lab essentials, life sciences, and liquid handling; pharma primary packaging materials, such as glass ampoules and tubular glass vials; and laboratory process system, comprising mini reactors system; jacketed reactor; parallel reaction; automated reaction; photo and specialty; and utilities and accessories system. The company also provides Industrial Process Equipment and Original Equipment Manufacturing solutions. It serves the pharma, chemical, research, agriculture, food and beverages, and environment industries. The company was formerly known as Klass Pack Limited and changed its name to Borosil Scientific Limited in December 2023. The company was founded in 1962 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T10:07:22+00:00","quote":{"price":115.55,"prevClose":115.77,"marketCap":1027.83,"high52":180.8,"low52":96.64,"pe":23.82,"bookValue":49.63,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":8.8952,"insiders":73.74,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-06-07","2024-06-10","2024-06-11","2024-06-12","2024-06-13","2024-06-14","2024-06-18","2024-06-19","2024-06-20","2024-06-21","2024-06-24","2024-06-25","2024-06-26","2024-06-27","2024-06-28","2024-07-01","2024-07-02","2024-07-03","2024-07-04","2024-07-05","2024-07-08","2024-07-09","2024-07-10","2024-07-11","2024-07-12","2024-07-15","2024-07-16","2024-07-18","2024-07-19","2024-07-22","2024-07-23","2024-07-24","2024-07-25","2024-07-26","2024-07-29","2024-07-30","2024-07-31","2024-08-01","2024-08-02","2024-08-05","2024-08-06"